# KIPPER: the Long Thruster keeps a dash going while the button is held (3
# a frame); the Lean Mix makes swimming burn three quarters; the Seeker Fins
# steer torpedoes at a creature ahead.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat clear
cheat calm
cheat tile 60 58
wait 2
cheat fit 2
cheat fuel 2000
hold RIGHT+B 40
expect boosting == 1
expect vx100 >= 250
expect fuel < 1900
# the Lean Mix
cheat unfit 2
cheat fit 8
cheat tile 60 58
wait 30
cheat fuel 2000
hold RIGHT 80
expect fuel >= 1938
expect fuel <= 1942
# Seeker Fins
cheat unfit 8
cheat fit 5
cheat tile 60 58
cheat face 1
wait 2
cheat foe 3 1060 920
wait 1
press A 1
wait 6
expect shot0_vy100 < 0
